    ⟨p1, p2, p3, p4, p5, p6, p7, p8, p9, p10, c2, a, b, c, d, l3, h17, h18, h19, h20, h21, h22, h23.2⟩
  refine ⟨hA, ?_⟩
  exact ⟨p1, p2, p3, p4, p5, p6, p7, p8, p9, p10, c2, a, b, c, d, l3, h17, h18, h19, h20, h21, h22, h23.1⟩

